      "message_parsed": "<blockquote class=\"xfBb-quote\" data-name=\"belomaxorka\">Hello. If you want change board lanugage (in whole) go to Admin panel, is called in russia as &quot;Администраторский раздел&quot;. That link located at the bottom of page (if you loggined as admin). Next go to &quot;Конфигурация&quot; in left sidebar. Next step click on &quot;Общие настройки&quot; at the top of page. Next find &quot;Язык по умолчанию&quot; selector and choose target language.</blockquote>Many many thanks",
